WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Can Hertz offers combine?
Two code fields do not prove two benefits. Read the specific offer terms first.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pay Now + another promotion
The reviewed Pay Now offer excludes other discounts, promotions and special rates.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Upgrade + prepaid rate
The reviewed upgrade excludes prepaid rates and combination with another offer or promotion.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Free day + another promotion
The reviewed weekly free-day offer excludes other discounts, promotions and special rates.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Keep the evidence
Save both offer URLs and the review time. Record permitted, blocked or unresolved.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Compare separately when blocked
Keep itinerary, vehicle and extras identical. Leave price cells blank until you have a real quote.

